          q: "<p>Host A sends <b>10 packets</b> of <b>1000 bytes</b> each to B over a path of <b>3 links</b> (2 store-and-forward routers), each 8 Mbps, propagation 0.5 ms per link. When does the last bit of the last packet reach B? Answer in <b>ms</b>, rounded to 1 decimal.</p>",
          answer: 13.5, tol: 0.05, unit: "ms", verify: "round(((3+10-1)*1000*8/8e6 + 3*0.5e-3)*1000, 1)",
